msgid "Appointments"
msgstr "Citas"

msgid ""
"Your diary: appointments by professional, free times, repeating bookings and "
"charging them at the till."
msgstr "Tu agenda: citas por profesional, horas libres, citas periódicas y cobro en el TPV."

msgid ""
"Appointments is the diary of a business that works by appointment. Each "
"booking joins a customer, one or more services and a professional at a time "
"that fits the opening hours, the professional's shift and time off, and no "
"other booking of theirs. See the day or the week by professional, drag a "
"booking to move it, confirm, start, complete or cancel it, keep repeating "
"bookings, let customers book and cancel within your rules, and charge a "
"booking at the till without typing it again."
msgstr "Citas es la agenda de un negocio que trabaja con cita previa. Cada reserva une una clienta, uno o varios servicios y un profesional a una hora que cabe en el horario del negocio, en el turno y las ausencias del profesional y sin pisar otra cita suya. Mira el día o la semana por profesional, arrastra una cita para moverla, confírmala, iníciala, complétala o cancélala, guarda citas periódicas, deja que tus clientas reserven y cancelen con tus reglas y cobra la cita en el TPV sin volver a teclearla."

